          "id": "5dafb95839a297961f41b0e5771e132f8a35eb82",
          "message": "The KEYS command needs to be keyless (#3341)\n\n* The KEYS command needs to be keyless\n\n* Finish keyless KEYS command impl\n\n* Rm useless line in legacy KEYS build\n\n* Remove Mono<Long> keys(KeyStreamingChannel<String> channel, String pattern) - deprecated since 6.0\n\n* Fix test\n\n* Revert \"Fix test\"\n\nThis reverts commit a0a3dfed071dc9388d66230506886deedeac8cf7.\n\n* Revert - Remove Mono<Long> keys(KeyStreamingChannel<String> channel, String pattern) - deprecated since 6.0\n\n* Revert - return type to K\n\n* Fix javadoc\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: aleksandar.todorov <a_t_todorov@yahoo.com>\nCo-authored-by: Igor Malinovskiy <u.glide@gmail.com>",
          "timestamp": "2025-10-22T06:45:21Z",
